# Node.js build artifacts
node_modules/
# NOTE: package.json and package-lock.json are SOURCE, not build artifacts — they must stay
# tracked. Ignoring them meant a CI checkout had no frontend/package.json, so the generated
# Dockerfile's `COPY package*.json ./` copied nothing and `npm install` died with ENOENT.
# The lock file also decides whether Aspire generates `npm ci` (reproducible) or `npm install`.
